E_\infty(t)
=\frac{\mu l\alpha^2}{4624k^2}
\left[
25\sin^2kt+145\cos^2kt
+64\sin kt\cos kt
\right]}.
$$
The limiting energy is periodic because the external force continually supplies the energy dissipated by drag.

